{
  "title": "Edge Location · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "사용자 가까이에서 콘텐츠 전달과 네트워크 진입을 돕는 Edge Location다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Edge Location</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#point-of-presence\">Point of Presence</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#regional-edge-cache\">Regional Edge Cache</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#origin\">Origin</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#origin-shield\">Origin Shield</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#edge-computing\">Edge Computing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>기초</span><span>19 / 62</span></div><h1>Edge Location</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 5 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Edge Location은 사용자 가까운 곳에서 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 글로벌 네트워크에 진입하거나 콘텐츠를 전달하는 위치다. 애플리케이션 서버와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a>를 배치하는 Availability Zone과 역할이 다르다.</p><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a>에서는 요청이 가까운 Edge Location으로 들어가며, Cache에 없는 데이터만 Origin에서 가져온다. 사용자 지연을 줄이는 효과와 Origin 부하를 줄이는 효과를 구분해서 이해해야 한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Cache Hit와 Cache Miss\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Cache Hit와 Cache Miss</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Cache hit</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Viewer</strong><small>가까운 Edge로 요청</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Edge Cache</strong><small>유효한 객체 발견</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Response</strong><small>Origin 요청 감소</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Cache miss</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Viewer</strong><small>Edge에 객체 없음</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Cache layers → Origin</strong><small>정책에 따라 원본 조회</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Response + Cache</strong><small>다음 요청에 재사용</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">개인화·동적 요청은 Cache Policy와 Origin 동작을 별도로 설계한다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"point-of-presence\"><h2>Point of Presence<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#point-of-presence\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#point-of-presence\">Point of Presence</a>에는 Edge Location이 포함된다. Viewer의 요청을 수신하고 Cache Policy에 따라 객체를 제공한다. 가까운 위치에 Cache가 있어도 개인화 데이터나 Cache되지 않는 요청은 Origin에 도달한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"regional-edge-cache\"><h2>Regional Edge Cache<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#regional-edge-cache\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Edge Location과 Origin 사이에서 더 큰 Cache 계층을 제공한다. 여러 Edge Location이 같은 객체를 요청할 때 Origin 요청 수를 줄이는 데 도움이 된다. 모든 요청 유형이 동일한 Cache 경로를 사용하는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"origin\"><h2>Origin<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#origin\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>원본 데이터가 있는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>, HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> Server 등이다. Edge Location에 Cache가 있더라도 Origin의 권한·가용성·용량을 설계해야 한다. Cache Miss와 동적 요청이 집중되면 Origin이 병목이 될 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"origin-shield\"><h2>Origin Shield<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#origin-shield\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a>에 추가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#origin-shield\">Origin Shield</a> 계층을 사용하면 여러 Cache가 Origin으로 보내는 중복 요청을 더 줄일 수 있다. 선택한 위치와 Origin의 지연을 고려한다. 별도 과금 요소가 있어 모든 배포에서 기본 선택은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"edge-computing\"><h2>Edge Computing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#edge-computing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a> Functions와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a>@Edge는 요청·응답 처리 과정에서 코드를 실행한다. 간단한 Header·URL <span class=\"full-name\">(Uniform Resource Locator)</span> 변경과 더 복잡한 Origin 연계 작업의 지원 범위가 다르다. 장기 실행 서버를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 배치하는 대체재로 이해하면 안 된다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>전 세계 사용자에게 정적 이미지를 전달할 때 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>를 Origin으로 두고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a> Edge Cache에서 반복 요청을 처리한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>엣지는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>나 새 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>이 아니다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudFront/latest/DeveloperGuide/Introduction.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AmazonCloudFront/latest/DeveloperGuide/Introduction.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q003/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q003\" data-question=\"Q003\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q003</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q003/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to reduce static image download latency for users worldwide and lower requests to its origin server. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q003\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS Multi-AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q003\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q003\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q003\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS snapshots</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a>가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/\">엣지</a>에 콘텐츠를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">캐시</a>해 사용자 가까이 전달한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/\">Edge Location</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q082\" data-question=\"Q082\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q082</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q082/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A design serves private S3 objects through CloudFront using a domain name. Which service-to-role mapping is correct?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 provides DNS, CloudFront delivers content, and S3 stores objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 performs HTTP path-based load balancing</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 caches S3 objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront grants IAM roles</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 응답과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CDN</a> 캐싱, 객체 저장은 각 서비스의 다른 역할이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q023\" data-question=\"Q023\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q023</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q023/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants DNS responses for a domain to switch to another Region based on health checks. Which service is central to this design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q023\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q023\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS KMS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q023\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q023\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 헬스 체크와 장애 조치 라우팅 정책을 쓴다. 클라이언트 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">캐시</a> 때문에 전환은 즉시 완료되지 않을 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q025\" data-question=\"Q025\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q025</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q025/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs fixed IP addresses and optimized routing to healthy TCP endpoints in multiple Regions. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q025\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Transfer Acceleration alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q025\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q025\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront object caching alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q025\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Global Accelerator</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/\">Global Accelerator</a>는 anycast 고정 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 글로벌 네트워크를 활용해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>로 전달한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/\">Global Accelerator</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q024\" data-question=\"Q024\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q024</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q024/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Requests to /api and /images on the same domain must be routed to different backends based on their HTTP paths. Which load balancer type should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>는 경로 기반 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 라우팅을 지원한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a>만으로 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 경로를 해석하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/\">이전 용어 <b>ECS / EKS / Fargate</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">다음 용어 <b>EFS</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
